      "writtenOn": "2023-11-17T11:05:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting, I googled a bit and looks like `.sdata` is used to keep small variables indeed.\n\n\u003e I\u0027m not sure how portable is this, so I think the safest way is to explicit specify a section name.\n\nAgreed.",
